    <informations>Shelly Dimmer 0/1-10V PM Gen3 — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: − + S2 O S1 L N.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-dimmer-0-1-10v-pm-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_bc2b994bad590feefd69beb1ebcc70fd3564a395943990ed01faf3976653cc02/MicrosoftTeams-image%20(10).png?cb=53e0f289cdda3f8cea5fcf0bf428b39b
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_9feb05bbf5da840c9edae4f3718e1495a75004cbc5cb61bf348e0989e5f6725b/0_1-10V-Dimmer-gen3-internal-schematics.png?cb=6d3196c11f90e3b2dff1112731c3edca
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_3e3b334fb7781f0598cd162501927c5ad1516caeeb62557bd54b987fd651bf41/Shelly%20Dimmer%200_1-10V%20PM%20Gen3%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf?cb=4741f7244e53a00435cdb1dfd3d230d7

Notes:
- Seven actual screws occupying8pitch positions; blank pitch2 between isolated0/1-10V pair and mains block.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
